From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Iscle <albertiscle9@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 02:17:51 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Android.bp: Make the crosvm crates visible to vendor

Qualcomm's qcrosvm, the virtual machine monitor of its Gunyah guest VMs,
lives in vendor/qcom/opensource/crosvm-gunyah and builds on these
crates.

Change-Id: I3b00c4df8d7ce5979d3426587d5310b180609026
---
 Android.bp | 10 ++++++++--
 1 file changed, 8 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/Android.bp b/Android.bp
index 8d4f86b55..22534041e 100644
--- a/Android.bp
+++ b/Android.bp
@@ -320,6 +320,12 @@ rust_defaults {
             enabled: false,
         },
     },
-    defaults_visibility: ["//external/crosvm:__subpackages__"],
-    visibility: ["//external/crosvm:__subpackages__"],
+    defaults_visibility: [
+        "//external/crosvm:__subpackages__",
+        "//vendor:__subpackages__",
+    ],
+    visibility: [
+        "//external/crosvm:__subpackages__",
+        "//vendor:__subpackages__",
+    ],
 }
